m/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-27T12:17:23Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T12:17:23Z","body":"Done and done.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3585561839/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3585788983","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113217#issuecomment-3585788983","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113217","id":3585788983,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Vusw3","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-27T13:10:58Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T13:12:54Z","body":"> If there were actual methods that did take some \"file\" value I'd say it would be different, but without that I'd say it's not critical.\r\n\r\nParameter name changes are never truly \"critical\", to be honest. By hoping any of them are, even smaller inconsistencies in the names can never be addressed.\r\nI guess this PR is a huge case, however. I thought I was just going to [change a few functions](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107536#discussion_r2146997169), but it ended up being a\r\n\r\n> I'd restrict it to just the documentation side if we do anything\r\n\r\nI wouldn't mind _just_ changing the exposed names because that would solve my pet peeve anyway. It'd just be inconsistent.\r\n\r\n> Are there any reports or posts on forums etc. indicating that people are running into issues due to the naming?\r\n\r\nNo. Good luck finding anything of the sort. These are the minor things that trip up developers _just a bit_, but not enough to talk about it on any social platform. Inconsistent terminology add to the general sense of unease and the more accessible we make the class reference (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/91060, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113214), the more noticeable it is going to be.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3585788983/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3585800995","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113217#issuecomment-3585800995","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113217","id":3585800995,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Vuvsj","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-27T13:13:59Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T13:13:59Z","body":"I'd say that the name alone isn't enough to cause confusion, it has to be a case where it's ambiguous if the parameter _can_ be a file in the first place, I can't imagine almost any of these being of that kind, it would require users to assume that you can get this data from the *contents* of a file, which considering the range of expertise of users is possible but IMO extremely unlikely, and I'd say those users wouldn't be using those methods in the first place, at least not without reading the documentation\r\n\r\nSo I don't think that these trip developers up at all","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3585800995/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]